  "goodToKnow": "Bezwingen means to conquer or defeat: einen Gipfel bezwingen, einen Gegner bezwingen, and to overcome: seine Angst bezwingen. It's a bit literary but common in sports reports. In 1978, Reinhold Messner and Peter Habeler were the first to bezwingen Everest without supplementary oxygen. From zwingen (to force). Irregular: bezwang, bezwungen."
